OL,3,AMore flight delays expected after
OL,4,Ahundreds cancelled by air traffic
OL,5,Acontrol glitch
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlight delays are expected to continue
OL,8,Fon Wednesday after an air traffic
OL,9,Fcontrol problem cancelled hundreds of
OL,10,Fflights across the UK.
OL,12,FTens of thousands of passengers were
OL,13,Faffected by the disruption and tracking
OL,14,Fwebsite FlightRadar24 said up to 1,000
OL,15,Fflights were cancelled after a glitch
OL,16,Faffecting air traffic control provider
OL,17,FNats.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
