OL,3,AUS slaps import ban on Canadian
OL,4,Aalcohol, motorbikes and other goods
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US is banning a slew of Canadian
OL,7,Fproducts, including alcoholic spirits,
OL,8,Fdairy goods and motorbikes, as its
OL,9,Fneighbour's retaliatory tariffs on
OL,10,FAmerican goods come into force.
OL,12,FIn a series of executive orders on
OL,13,FTuesday, US President Donald Trump said
OL,14,Fthat Canada is "discriminating" against
OL,15,Fthe US and outlined the import ban,
OL,16,Fwhich will begin 29 September.
OL,18,FEarlier on Tuesday, Canada Prime
OL,19,FMinister Mark Carney said in a video
OL,20,Faddress that his country's pivot away
OL,21,Ffrom the US as its largest trading
OL,22,Fpartner "will come at a cost".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
