OL,3,ARenoir paintings worth millions stolen
OL,4,Ain French museum heist
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo paintings by the impressionist
OL,7,Fartist Pierre-Auguste Renoir have been
OL,8,Fstolen from a museum in the south of
OL,9,FFrance.
OL,11,FTwo thieves broke into the Renoir
OL,12,FMuseum in Cagnes-sur-Mer early on
OL,13,FTuesday, seizing four paintings but
OL,14,Fdropping two of the works in the museum
OL,15,Fgardens as they escaped, local Mayor
OL,16,FBryan Masson said.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
